<title>GERMANY: Bundesbank data show fall in net reserves in week.</title>
<headline>Bundesbank data show fall in net reserves in week.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank data released on Wednesday show that net currency reserves fell to about 106.1 billion marks in the week ending December 15 from about 106.5 billion the previous week.</p>
<p>The Bundesbank provided the following reserve data: (in billions of marks)</p>
<p>    Banking week ended		    Dec 15	  Dec 7</p>
<p>    Gross currency reserves	     122.1	   122.6</p>
<p>    Foreign liabilities		   16.0	    16.1</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
